docs {
  # Send Test Webhook (deprecated alias)
  
  Same handler as **Send Test Webhook**, kept for one minor release after #201.
  
  **Method:** POST  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/settings/project/webhook-test`  
  **Route name:** `project.webhook-test` (deprecated)
  
  Prefer `POST /settings/project/integrations/webhook-test`.
  
  Slack/Telegram notifier tests have the same pattern:
  
  | Preferred | Deprecated alias |
  | --------- | ---------------- |
  | `…/integrations/slack-notifier-test` | `/settings/project/slack-notifier-test` |
  | `…/integrations/telegram-notifier-test` | `/settings/project/telegram-notifier-test` |
}
